<title>SOUTH KOREA: Port conditions update-South Korea-Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update-South Korea-Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BUSAN, July 1 - 196 vessels in port. 71 berthed, 125 anchored. Delay two to three days.</p>
<p>ULSAN - 100 vessels in port. 35 berthed, 65 anchored. Delay one to two days.</p>
<p>INCHON - 76 vessels in port. 44 berthed, 32 anchored. Delay one to two days.</p>
</text>
